  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "f3f40663-383e-432d-9634-cdbef8b51696",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol ao sentido em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1566a66e-9ce2-44cd-b51b-586ebe23e76b",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a situação antes do sintoma aparecer em detalhe.</p><p><strong>No me encuentro bien.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Não estou me sentindo bem.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b522abafecbf41feb87add3d057edfd3_l02b01-sick-checkin-scene.png?Expires=1794099553&Signature=QEJrKHypZ4VPE5cX2Q~6qxwl6MScou~kCfmfzr5Rvg9J1Sy5HyzBNlG5d6XXGIgQtL7QwLj1Tc68AhlaJg9oLcrK6EQInqKCVANot1eBUZ4OpKY0x2sodz3x-uXlANNK-LXEyxR735ngcHvSc5w6u0M4l5MOyh9rzkpg7NJ1ZXpiNw0i~WmyVd9XYglgRL9uFKBlckyqZxX7dPzuzOrGnkj0YiOtaFpydJ6VL1hN7~ChQKkSbUq~ZKeWMoSipH6DRo7y-nxqiIRDFMjg4v~VYsCLMr68uAd6-Mx9pnyrZfnKo5n2YfXahCnRdoMbt13-x~EjFynbhB3gqy0Qrneqqw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/39fb873d5da94351bca984b10304f38a_l02b01-no-me-encuentro-bien.mp3?Expires=1794099553&Signature=WXYXX-YMMYlpUoVRKn8Lrqf~rFw6KaAwdQwXfY8VU4y1fl9joG~-v7HdtXxOuQSko9SfaGBi1KnZrgIxTFtFQq1SzNoJHiBV1VTS17ykRM7QR24q9zstrwCq79Z6f7tXzMMmMrEljenAHI5EAS38jDlT~JzmM8VQdOsSyhhP30J7PTyq29IytX9rapsG49dYk595ZHc-uIq11SFIRLqSWGmItIspSM3Qtpii4E~jHApjymV1n6kHf03k7Nkwon-Kdwo98sGXa63QKl63yGowBv-HP4Zpo8P7FaqfHjxGfb8umCGiu0SR82rbxM2HCvwPUyPP57yln15RJeucWsMmZA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
