    {
      "id": "ebd41005-cfce-4301-9b7d-822ade058377",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe quando essa frase faz sentido na vida real.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "859fd260-2f17-4bad-809f-04fb7ce91d55",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>No me encuentro bien.</strong> funciona como uma abertura curta quando a pessoa quer dizer que está mal de forma geral.</p><p>Ela costuma aparecer antes do sintoma específico, como dor ou febre.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e8e9024a-680c-4e51-a534-2bf82ff5594e",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol ao sintoma mostrado.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "b36d7116-1b92-483f-a020-3cb5503626b1",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora o mal-estar fica mais específico.</p><p><strong>Me duele la cabeza.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Estou com dor de cabeça.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/28a2f921a3064fe3989227217badd783_l02b03-headache-scene.png?Expires=1794099553&Signature=y5J1vLkl-W78Ct-oQYHHajPu7KAd3TG3FMqEBujzHwvU4hKYFRibx6~UuObaAUBeknwWdKrDf2C9Ki8SlzpYGjQoKZZqigLc-ODHpztgUWRf8wlKC0v6fDfGnvzXbPHCKfy6wI1gbLWw4XK~S1UJo2hcbPCY7NnGG3weDoScUCdoH1CCb8Dq~8EcJU-lzgWAcReFDlkilmT9dPWb7AJVh7EjQyIyBJkIyIbLeQfLxSUiQ60VxukX2-VZ8X3tdNqeeTeGbQcg8uSd1erEysc3W2gu00fmaX-w6VZbUOgclC-lzQ3dHo9oqEl0HwiR40Kpe93d-2Y1l1GhLtNzNiM7ug__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/dd8b6703f95e4d899785d8b9461d6077_l02b03-me-duele-la-cabeza.mp3?Expires=1794099553&Signature=x2GqzX6VeT4loJHlqoYZOc1h2uJX7p0UnO1Y09QQNXFAevGwGZdf5LpcQvbF8681EKre19skggnatEH5-SV0HByCJPaN6GLT2KLQz0LTOFLav8Um~j9aT-qTHqJY~iFbFIltOVeFTz8wE1Z1oP~X3WH09zcPwiygM58zeKRcCiumzQJWU6ZI30ZgPeTdx0QSOOoF7DJW-fQQ0duPITwm3pcrBoVKXE3845n~Y0AL~egcpOsTG37bZAoqrjMpXnP8gs48KOMifdwzi6FJ4EUZnPCk7u3ry2XEUQOmXXSGildFZIiChlCowVKvWvLsJzeXALDXa3mre-353mtUv~87rQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
