    {
      "id": "b7adafb1-ba11-4040-b465-b028c45a5b96",
      "title": "Leia a nota e observe onde a frase mostra a dor de forma localizada.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "bc63d7eb-83ad-4490-900d-ef525a4aa7ec",
          "textContent": "<p>Com <strong>me duele</strong>, o foco vai para a parte do corpo que dói.</p><p>Em <strong>Me duele la cabeza.</strong>, a informação nova está em <strong>la cabeza</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "690da753-0d8d-4c9c-9584-307444e9c94f",
      "title": "Escute a nova frase e note que agora o sintoma não fala de dor, mas de uma condição do momento.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "7006a41f-58ea-4388-b60f-4dd1767c7c3f",
          "textContent": "<p>Nem todo sintoma fala de dor.</p><p><strong>Tengo fiebre.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Estou com febre.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b522abafecbf41feb87add3d057edfd3_l02b01-sick-checkin-scene.png?Expires=1794099553&Signature=QEJrKHypZ4VPE5cX2Q~6qxwl6MScou~kCfmfzr5Rvg9J1Sy5HyzBNlG5d6XXGIgQtL7QwLj1Tc68AhlaJg9oLcrK6EQInqKCVANot1eBUZ4OpKY0x2sodz3x-uXlANNK-LXEyxR735ngcHvSc5w6u0M4l5MOyh9rzkpg7NJ1ZXpiNw0i~WmyVd9XYglgRL9uFKBlckyqZxX7dPzuzOrGnkj0YiOtaFpydJ6VL1hN7~ChQKkSbUq~ZKeWMoSipH6DRo7y-nxqiIRDFMjg4v~VYsCLMr68uAd6-Mx9pnyrZfnKo5n2YfXahCnRdoMbt13-x~EjFynbhB3gqy0Qrneqqw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
